=== 1. adapter fixture ===
o1 SYN_US_01  100 -> filled
o2 SYN_US_02   50 -> rejected
o3 SYN_US_03   80 -> partially_filled
o4 SYN_US_04   40 -> unknown
o4 SYN_US_04   40 -> unknown (dup ignored)
o5 SYN_US_05   30 -> held_halted
intents=6 unique_orders_sent=5
reconcile after reconnect: gaps={'o4': (0, 40)} -> trust broker ledger, log, re-derive position
=== 2. paper != live (document-level notes, not tested on an account) ===
Alpaca paper: fills simulated vs NBBO; qty NOT checked vs NBBO size; no dividends simulated
IBKR paper: fills from top of book; some order types unsupported (e.g. VWAP, Auction)
=== 3. S-D: US session date vs Shanghai calendar date ===
fill 2026-07-06T13:31:00+00:00: NY session date 2026-07-06 09:31 | Shanghai 2026-07-06 21:31
